	(text "NOTES:\n- 5V/VBUS pin inactive on UART USB port\n- All components powered from 3.3V LDO\n- GY-906 has onboard 10k I2C pull-ups\n- Touch threshold: 27000 (ESP32-S3 ADC)\n- Sensing: conduction through glass wall"
